  description: '2+ monsters, including a Fish, Sea Serpent, or Aqua monster

    Your
    opponent cannot target WATER monsters this card points to with card effects.
    You can only use each of the following effects of "Mermail King - Neptabyss"
    once per turn. If a WATER monster(s) is sent to the GY to activate a card or
    effect (except during the Damage Step): You can take 1 "Abyss-" Equip Spell from
    your Deck or GY and either add it to your hand or equip it to this card. If this
    card in its owner''s possession is destroyed by an opponent''s card: You can
    add 1 "Atlantean" or "Mermail" monster from your Deck to your hand.'
